{"html":"<p>Java programs are made of objects. A <strong>class</strong> is the blueprint, like &quot;bank account&quot;: what data it holds and what it can do. An <strong>object</strong> is one real thing built from it, like Ana&#39;s account. Once you can write good classes, the rest of Java makes sense.</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-first-class\">A First Class</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> long</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> balanceCents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">owner</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">long</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> balanceCents</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">.owner </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">.balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> balanceCents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> deposit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">long</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> cents</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">        balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> cents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> long</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> getBalanceCents</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> balanceCents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>It has three parts:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fields</strong> hold the object&#39;s data: <code>owner</code> and <code>balanceCents</code>. Each object has its own copy.</li>\n<li>A <strong>constructor</strong> runs when an object is created, and sets up its fields.</li>\n<li><strong>Methods</strong> are what the object can do: <code>deposit</code>, <code>getBalanceCents</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Create objects with <code>new</code>, and call methods with a dot:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> account</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">10_000</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">account.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">deposit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2_500</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(account.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">getBalanceCents</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 12500</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"this\">this</h2>\n<p>Inside a class, <code>this</code> means &quot;the current object&quot;. In the constructor, <code>this.owner = owner;</code> copies the <strong>parameter</strong> <code>owner</code> into the <strong>field</strong> <code>owner</code>, which has the same name.</p>\n<h2 id=\"encapsulation-private-fields\">Encapsulation: Private Fields</h2>\n<p>The fields are <code>private</code>: only code inside <code>BankAccount</code> can touch them. Other code must go through the methods. That&#39;s <strong>encapsulation</strong>, and it&#39;s what lets a class protect its own rules:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> deposit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">long</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> cents) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (cents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        throw</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> IllegalArgumentException</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"deposit must be positive\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> cents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> withdraw</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">long</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> cents) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (cents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> balanceCents) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">return</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// never below zero</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> cents;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>If the field were public, any code could write <code>account.balanceCents = -500;</code> and the rule would be gone.</p>\n<p>Don&#39;t add a getter and a setter for every field out of habit. A <code>setBalance</code> method would undo the protection. Offer methods that mean something in your domain, like <code>deposit</code> and <code>withdraw</code>.</p>\n<p><code>final</code> fields, like <code>owner</code>, are set once in the constructor and never change. Make fields <code>final</code> whenever you can: such objects are easier to reason about.</p>\n<h2 id=\"several-constructors\">Several Constructors</h2>\n<p>A class can have several constructors with different parameters. One can call another with <code>this(…)</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(String owner) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(owner, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// a new account starts empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The constructor is also the place to refuse bad input, so that an object is never created in an invalid state:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> IllegalArgumentException</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"balance can't be negative\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"static-belonging-to-the-class\">static: Belonging to the Class</h2>\n<p>A <code>static</code> field or method belongs to the class itself, not to each object:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> created</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// one value, shared by all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">        created</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">++</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> created</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> created;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Counter.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">created</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 2</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>static</code> is right for constants (<code>static final double TAX_RATE = 0.2;</code>) and helper methods like <code>Math.max</code>. Avoid static fields that change: they&#39;re global state, shared by everything, and hard to test.</p>\n<h2 id=\"tostring\">toString</h2>\n<p>Printing an object shows something like <code>BankAccount@1b6d3586</code> by default. Override <code>toString</code> to show something useful:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">@</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">public</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> owner </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \": \"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> balanceCents </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \" cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>System.out.println(account)</code> now prints <code>Ana: 12500 cents</code>. Logs and debuggers use it too.</p>\n<h2 id=\"variables-hold-references\">Variables Hold References</h2>\n<p>A variable of a class type doesn&#39;t hold the object, it holds a <strong>reference</strong> to it. Copying the variable copies the reference, not the object:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> a1</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ben\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">BankAccount</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> a2</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> a1;       </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// same object, two names</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">a2.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">deposit</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(a1.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">getBalanceCents</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 100</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The same happens when you pass an object to a method: the method can change the object you passed. And a reference can be <code>null</code>, pointing to nothing: calling a method on it throws a <code>NullPointerException</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-answer-in-short\">The Answer in Short</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>A class is a blueprint with fields, constructors and methods; <code>new</code> creates an object from it.</li>\n<li>Keep fields <code>private</code> and expose meaningful methods that protect the rules.</li>\n<li>Make fields <code>final</code> when they don&#39;t change, and reject bad input in the constructor.</li>\n<li><code>static</code> members belong to the class: good for constants and helpers, risky for changing state.</li>\n<li>Variables hold references: copying one shares the same object.</li>\n</ol>\n"}